  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6288f3b684f2ba4d385f85f0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的爸爸是体育老师！！\r\n他热血！正直！！心胸宽大！！\r\n并教会我许多重要的事情！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b706f739731ecd458e82483bfaa5450182fc1ae630980e600e59d47d3977427",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc7ea4d7f088b42ea6b3861e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和八重会一起坐禅！\r\n经历严苛的精神修行后，\r\n感觉我跟她变得心意相通了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42c1543f77d546261a0490de2bc6aaf79b3e3a5c25c9d269820c27540e08e56e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c9bc4716d52ea471e09876",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "少年漫画可谓是心灵的圣经！\r\n友情、成长、与劲敌的火热对决！\r\n……唔呜呜，太热血了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48a4c9b0be555075c21e568c5682db5f0badd4c11c51ffe2d22b3a3f2eb527eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:479f87c139bf39ac5f7ca968",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗前辈的跑法既自律又耿直……\r\n我想成为她的劲敌，\r\n堂堂正正地与她对决！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab1faf4126efe5287d62026cbcea7f869f517144ded0bedaa10fb832884315ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb1fddd4884e6bddf4597b45",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剑道和武术都有教人「残心」\r\n这句话！意思就是、那个……\r\n要不松懈全力冲刺，之类的意思啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe7bd9811b8272725fff15b50550ba4586a84290224a8229b3b490c9037975bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:428ad5ffdfa0f5ce88b3b107",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了避免肚子着凉，\r\n跳舞时要将所有的热情，\r\n尽全力灌注在肚子里！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c635b040f916086259ae641b8caac881818b833feb1fb0d5ac8264d34e474968",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c82350e7525810177bc29e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与认真对决过的劲敌们\r\n穿着相同的服装跳舞，\r\n这种认同彼此的感觉很热血呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27434c5c778b3ffa3e26ed4fda0040c810f4f8804839a2a1d49db3ce82d6a9e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16748e9bb325c10654b98fde",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爸爸和妈妈都称赞过我的决胜服！！\r\n嘿嘿，不枉我将自己的心意\r\n都灌注在里面！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b077c29611d7a434e5e89cedef53b0597f2720b76d8816c77e6e6677c1e5574d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ddce49b84ec211fdaecefc7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为是特别的服装，\r\n所以我也要拿出特别的表现！\r\n「唔喔喔喔喔喔！」的感觉！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cccceaa99298c72e997faa7f7d6397ebd82612b94fec456e963b9e7ec0e8f0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1faaf0807f26ef288490d146",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼啊啊……唔唔，这样不行！！\r\n小手！面！胴！面！小手─！！\r\n我要挥剑唤醒睡迷糊的身体！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71a97a30d8cfbd8b79d00fe4cfbaf3c2b4d860c6ede01ca85b9ab3f056425d80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f70b6ec6f32ac3caef563c5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吃饭时要细嚼慢咽……！\r\n呜唔……肚子饿的时候，\r\n总是会不小心狼吞虎咽……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b46511836da8c81325476bd94f6c5799e326a718e1f4b885e963074b66932bcc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a046fa83be714375eaeacc72",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要去检查有没有人违反\r\n门禁时间！！\r\n一发现就要立刻抓起来！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e1be15dab80af07b869119b7e9ddb2b6f6b08654dcf8b68c1984f6aae5b3ddb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f00db629eccf4b2d3f5fd103",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一开始是最关键的时期！\r\n就算是新生也必须谨守纪律！！\r\n这样大家一定能度过快乐的生活！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f0664a6e78e5601f1e35428fa5b46637cb6cd2c0b513a9bc70ab94b2cf6ad7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ffeb25cb5449361ab89d414",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我喜欢在夏天跑步！\r\n流完一身汗会感到很畅快！\r\n训练员要不要也来一起跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "841ce20cd796cec35261c157a97fad2e17fe80dccadc9b7f6be61ba0eee782d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:218a80b08402d582d9eb1954",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋天是最适合运动的季节！！\r\n也就是说短暂的秋天是没得休息的！\r\n我要挑战精神和肉体的极限！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6df32e4c8b7b09b38f48b6cac299eaf80b282a0f6901b58da46e7768bb5e3b86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea81ad0d770c537be21e1bd9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天气冷的时候就要用干布摩擦身体！\r\n虽然我小时候在雪中这么做后，\r\n就被妈妈骂了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "412f560a5ee7fca2714efeb57172f2a4d057eb817e533d9e070635a5a7755a5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1147d32722f622927f6f0aa",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我把这副打扮的照片寄回了老家，\r\n听说父亲看见后吓到站不起来……\r\n有那么吃惊吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d4af688c28fa6ebf86b3693556c0249625d32321b09efcf589496f157ce7071",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:780ce682153c7e818c911e96",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时尚很难懂呢……\r\n像是○○系等等的……\r\n简直跟备考一样是强敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33dce45d3b37dd14411eb5e6d953637ab4c606ed1b8eb56e677e36b4ebca22fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fa6089b5956e047beeca160",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "刚刚见到了八重，\r\n但她却一时认不出我来，\r\n装扮的影响力实在很惊人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff89ecae210014e4fd0726ee004774ea77edc4152d1a3c3d2fbbb20b26d0f7aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c52a439b144d6fc899f2dd8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先前城市和佐敦约我一起去\r\n服饰店……但我感觉自己被她们\r\n当成了换装洋娃娃……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02c1ccd44a09f21baa13b77a78b1ee8ceffb8dc5ef07e54f857cc9d7f005f0b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4414d6f2332d2ae6b9b84e84",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太阳说的话有时候很难理解呢……\r\n不过没关系，只要用心沟通\r\n就轻松多了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8e183f1281a7649d7491578154fee72dfb748e2998d1d89e3394af117a7986a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6713bb74f4cb4300c9795c50",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然在旅行时，四处游山玩水\r\n也很不错……但到头来，\r\n不论去哪里都会忍不住想跑步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ec64f784df60b5b3327d36218e0582765880baf57f9819f42f2f3da23c1ad4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b4bd593158aaf60d549a24c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可以慰劳众纠察队员的烤肉大会\r\n实在很棒。不仅整顿心灵\r\n也整顿了纪律！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be494ca549158a7750d855db64bb1182af3e3e466249c574980994768521ce20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b2fd30cdc765001a272fa55",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "施放烟火前要仔细阅读\r\n使用说明！还必须准备好\r\n用来灭火的水！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc3d93b2370b1510f6db19ff5419d4f4e876d628be5484892f378a78e36eac4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb20885ee7024f0d9822a2d3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说到赏花，总是会有人不小心\r\n玩得太忘我，打乱了纪律呢。\r\n所以巡逻是不可或缺的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "182d04278482db25f3d15234a94d00cf40c66edb28028d780f648fb1286fe66c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91024"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91024"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c4c4bd6de11e06c82cf34e5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实我里面穿着泳装。这样\r\n想游泳时就能随时去游泳池，\r\n非常方便！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51735604dd08378fa58be6f146cd1d1111aa5b50a00da34aa29f4c5755eba714",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91025"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91025"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:215efc322397ed846e234296",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说时值食欲大开的秋天，\r\n但吃太多肚子会凸出来……\r\n穿这件衣服就能警惕自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bda2f3eea20db5e430b78c6aede334c6e510581cf069405c95805ea39bbc298d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91026"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1053/91026"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7e163287c83d8654f109536",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下雪时穿凉鞋能让脚趾\r\n感受冰冷，藉此绷紧神经！\r\n还能磨练心志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7415058c4d4ee2cf61e58d0598d846a4710efd459601b5cd5a162802401bfd8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1053",
        "91027"
      ],
